WEBVTT

00:05:28.908 --> 00:05:31.569
isn't it all about what's our pleasure?

00:05:31.593 --> 00:05:33.301
There are a million different
kinds of pizza.

00:05:33.325 --> 00:05:35.087
There's a million different toppings.

00:05:35.111 --> 00:05:37.389
There's a million different
ways to eat pizza.

00:05:37.413 --> 00:05:40.338
And none of them are wrong.
They're different.

00:05:40.362 --> 00:05:42.786
And in this case, difference is good,

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:44.858
because that's going
to increase the chance

00:05:44.882 --> 00:05:47.442
that we're having a satisfying experience.

00:05:47.466 --> 00:05:50.402
And lastly, what's the expected
outcome of baseball?

00:05:50.426 --> 00:05:54.100
Well, in baseball, you play to win.

00:05:54.124 --> 00:05:56.633
You score as many runs as you can.

00:05:56.657 --> 00:05:58.621
There's always a winner in baseball,

00:05:58.645 --> 00:06:02.042
and that means there's always
a loser in baseball.